Z||000000||Shaun41178||01-27-2001||08:32 PM||||got my @ss handed to me!!  Yea I dont' win them all people.  This race was setup and we went out to  deserted road.  Lined up, three honks and i am out of the hole like a rocket.  i have a good 2 cars on him out of the hole and I am feeling good.  Auto goes to second and at about 4000 rpm it starts to misfire so I shut it off and the Z comes blowing past me.  We go again and the same thing happens with a misfire and me getting walked bad.  We go froma roll and at about a 45 start i jump a car on him but by 60 I am misfiring and he gains on me and by 70 he is leaving me pretty quickly.<P>Because of the misfire Ichecked my plugs today.  2 electrodes were toast and two plugs were loose in the heads.  I did have the plugs gapped at .55 which is way too much for nitrous but I wanted to see if my ignition could handle it.  I guess it couldn't.  So that is probably one cause of my loss and another is that I think I have a vacuum leak.  This might be causing me to run lean too at WOT on nitrous.  I might have got bad gas too but Idid have 92 in it but anthing is possible.  I should have beat him as my qtr mile times are faster according to the timeslips but not last night it wasn't faster.  I gotta give it up for the Z.  It proved itself last night<P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Preferred Performance</A>||||reg||1
Z||000001||88formula||01-27-2001||09:23 PM||||Shaun41178 you got to be careful man. Running lean on nitrous is the number one reason people blow there engines with nitrous. That’s a good way to melt a piston too. Looks like it’s time for an ignition upgrade.<P>Next time though you will get him!<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||rogergarrison||01-27-2001||09:32 PM||||yep, cant beat em all the time. I never found out - was this a camaro Z-28 or a Nissan 300Z. Those Nissans are screamers, especially with twin turbos.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Slammed Fiero||01-27-2001||10:12 PM||||My friend Phil used to have a 93 300 ZXTT , Greddy exhaust , Dialed up the boost , new factory turbo's. <P>So one night we started to play...... Down a street called princess , 2 lane , short from light to light..... I was right beside him every light , he looked over and comented on how quick I was. I would roast him off the lights (13 sec 300ZX) So then we hit a long section , At about 40mph he beat me like a rented mule. I heard WOOOOOOOOOOSHHHHHHH and his massive tires started spinning and I was a parked car.... I was good entertainment!!<P><BR>Now phil has a 93 240 SX , needless to say I spank him...... The repairs on his car got too be too much ....<P><P>------------------<BR>Jonathan M McCreery<BR>86 GT<BR>New Custom White face gauges 17" Tr motorsports Typhoons Ground Control coil overs , Big bars front and rear , Mustang scoop , accel coil , no cat , 4spd , short shift , poly dog bone and bushings momo pedals and shift knob , round headlight conversion , Geni stainless steel oval exhaust tips. Pioneer 6000 CD player , Sony Mobile Amp. Currently doing big brake conversion...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/jssig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
